    "Reason : 1 - The proposed outbuilding, due to its excessive size and scale and inappropriate position within the rear garden, would harm the living conditions of the adjoining neighbour at 72 The Alders, in terms of increased sense of enclosure, contrary to Local Plan Policies CC2 and SC7 and the intent of the Residential Extension Guidelines.",
